dualsense-tester -- https://github.com/daidr/dualsense-tester

Portions of prototype/ds5bridge/protocol.py and prototype/ds5bridge/crc.py are
hand-written Python ports of, or transcriptions of protocol constants from:
  src/utils/dualsense/btAudioStream.ts       (buildReportSix)
  src/utils/dualsense/microphoneProtocol.ts  (buildBtMicStateReport,
                                              buildBtMicControlReport)
  src/utils/dualsense/ds.util.ts             (sendOutputReportFactory)
  src/utils/dualsense/crc32.util.ts          (CRC-32 seed bytes)
  src/router/DualSense/_utils/offset.util.ts (createInputReportOffset)
  src/router/DualSense/views/_OutputPanel/outputStruct.ts and OutputPanel.vue
                                             (SetState field offsets and
                                              valid-flag bit names)

