SpeexDSP 1.2.1 -- https://github.com/xiph/speexdsp

The microphone echo canceller's native core (emulator/native, built into
ds5aec.dll and shipped in every build) compiles SpeexDSP's MDF echo canceller,
its resampler and the KISS FFT it uses, vendored unmodified in
emulator/native/speexdsp/ from the release tag SpeexDSP-1.2.1 (archive SHA-256
d17ca363654556a4ff1d02cc13d9eb1fc5a8642c90b40bd54ce266c3807b91a7). Their
notices follow, as the BSD licences require; the installer also places them
in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt next to the application.

